      "content": "<!-- \n  Plain UI - Segmented OTP & PIN Inputs (Origin UI Inspired)\n  Zero-JS HTML5 + Tailwind CSS v4 Segmented One-Time-Password & Verification Code Controls\n-->\n<div class=\"flex flex-col gap-10 p-6 max-w-4xl mx-auto font-sans text-zinc-900 dark:text-zinc-100\">\n\n  <!-- Section Header -->\n  <div class=\"space-y-1 border-b border-zinc-200 dark:border-zinc-800 pb-4\">\n    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n      <span class=\"inline-flex items-center rounded-md bg-zinc-100 dark:bg-zinc-800 px-2 py-0.5 text-xs font-medium text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-400\">Form Controls</span>\n      <span class=\"text-xs text-zinc-400\">•</span>\n      <span class=\"text-xs text-zinc-500\">MFA & Authentication</span>\n    </div>\n    <h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight\">Segmented OTP & PIN Inputs</h2>\n    <p class=\"text-sm text-zinc-500 dark:text-zinc-400\">\n      Segmented 4-box and 6-box numeric code inputs with auto-advance styling, hyphen group separators, error states, and masked password dots.\n    </p>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- Variant 1: Classic 6-Box OTP Input -->\n  <div class=\"flex flex-col gap-3\">\n    <div class=\"space-y-1\">\n      <label class=\"text-sm font-medium text-zinc-700 dark:text-zinc-300\">01. Classic 6-Digit Verification Code</label>\n      <p class=\"text-xs text-zinc-500 dark:text-zinc-400\">Enter the 6-digit code sent to your mobile device.</p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"6-digit verification code\">\n      <input type=\"text\" inputmode=\"numeric\" pattern=\"[0-9]\" maxlength=\"1\" autofocus class=\"size-11 rounded-lg border border-zinc-300 bg-white text-center font-mono text-lg font-semibold text-zinc-900 focus:border-zinc-900 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-zinc-900/10 dark:border-zinc-700 dark:bg-zinc-950 dark:text-zinc-100 dark:focus:border-zinc-300 dark:focus:ring-zinc-300/10\" />\n      <input type=\"text\" inputmode=\"numeric\" pattern=\"[0-9]\" maxlength=\"1\" class=\"size-11 rounded-lg border border-zinc-300 bg-white text-center font-mono text-lg font-semibold text-zinc-900 focus:border-zinc-900 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-zinc-900/10 dark:border-zinc-700 dark:bg-zinc-950 dark:text-zinc-100 dark:focus:border-zinc-300 dark:focus:ring-zinc-300/10\" />\n      <input type=\"text\" inputmode=\"numeric\" pattern=\"[0-9]\" maxlength=\"1\" class=\"size-11 rounded-lg border border-zinc-300 bg-white text-center font-mono text-lg font-semibold text-zinc-900 focus:border-zinc-900 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-zinc-900/10 dark:border-zinc-700 dark:bg-zinc-950 dark:text-zinc-100 dark:focus:border-zinc-300 dark:focus:ring-zinc-300/10\" />\n      <input type=\"text\" inputmode=\"numeric\" pattern=\"[0-9]\" maxlength=\"1\" class=\"size-11 rounded-lg border border-zinc-300 bg-white text-center font-mono text-lg font-semibold text-zinc-900 focus:border-zinc-900 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-zinc-900/10 dark:border-zinc-700 dark:bg-zinc-950 dark:text-zinc-100 dark:focus:border-zinc-300 dark:focus:ring-zinc-300/10\" />\n      <input type=\"text\" inputmode=\"numeric\" pattern=\"[0-9]\" maxlength=\"1\" class=\"size-11 rounded-lg border border-zinc-300 bg-white text-center font-mono text-lg font-semibold text-zinc-900 focus:border-zinc-900 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-zinc-900/10 dark:border-zinc-700 dark:bg-zinc-950 dark:text-zinc-100 dark:focus:border-zinc-300 dark:focus:ring-zinc-300/10\" />\n      <input type=\"text\" inputmode=\"numeric\" pattern=\"[0-9]\" maxlength=\"1\" class=\"size-11 rounded-lg border border-zinc-300 bg-white text-center font-mono text-lg font-semibold text-zinc-900 focus:border-zinc-900 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-zinc-900/10 dark:border-zinc-700 dark:bg-zinc-950 dark:text-zinc-100 dark:focus:border-zinc-300 dark:focus:ring-zinc-300/10\" />\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- Variant 2: 4-Box PIN Code Input -->\n  <div class=\"flex flex-col gap-3\">\n    <div class=\"space-y-1\">\n      <label class=\"text-sm font-medium text-zinc-700 dark:text-zinc-300\">02. 4-Box Security PIN</label>\n      <p class=\"text-xs text-zinc-500 dark:text-zinc-400\">Enter your 4-digit card PIN.</p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2.5\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"4-digit security PIN\">\n      <input type=\"text\" inputmode=\"numeric\" pattern=\"[0-9]\" maxlength=\"1\" class=\"size-12 rounded-xl border border-zinc-300 bg-white text-center font-mono text-xl font-bold text-zinc-900 focus:border-zinc-900 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-zinc-900/10 dark:border-zinc-700 dark:bg-zinc-950 dark:text-zinc-100 dark:focus:border-zinc-300 dark:focus:ring-zinc-300/10\" />\n      <input type=\"text\" inputmode=\"numeric\" pattern=\"[0-9]\" maxlength=\"1\" class=\"size-12 rounded-xl border border-zinc-300 bg-white text-center font-mono text-xl font-bold text-zinc-900 focus:border-zinc-900 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-zinc-900/10 dark:border-zinc-700 dark:bg-zinc-950 dark:text-zinc-100 dark:focus:border-zinc-300 dark:focus:ring-zinc-300/10\" />\n      <input type=\"text\" inputmode=\"numeric\" pattern=\"[0-9]\" maxlength=\"1\" class=\"size-12 rounded-xl border border-zinc-300 bg-white text-center font-mono text-xl font-bold text-zinc-900 focus:border-zinc-900 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-zinc-900/10 dark:border-zinc-700 dark:bg-zinc-950 dark:text-zinc-100 dark:focus:border-zinc-300 dark:focus:ring-zinc-300/10\" />\n      <input type=\"text\" inputmode=\"numeric\" pattern=\"[0-9]\" maxlength=\"1\" class=\"size-12 rounded-xl border border-zinc-300 bg-white text-center font-mono text-xl font-bold text-zinc-900 focus:border-zinc-900 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-zinc-900/10 dark:border-zinc-700 dark:bg-zinc-950 dark:text-zinc-100 dark:focus:border-zinc-300 dark:focus:ring-zinc-300/10\" />\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- Variant 3: 6-Box OTP with Hyphen Separator (3 - 3 Layout) -->\n  <div class=\"flex flex-col gap-3\">\n    <label class=\"text-sm font-medium text-zinc-700 dark:text-zinc-300\">03. 6-Digit OTP with Hyphen Grouping</label>\n    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n      <!-- Group 1 -->\n      <div class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5\">\n        <input type=\"text\" inputmode=\"numeric\" pattern=\"[0-9]\" maxlength=\"1\" class=\"size-10 rounded-lg border border-zinc-300 bg-white text-center font-mono text-base font-semibold text-zinc-900 focus:border-zinc-900 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-zinc-900/10 dark:border-zinc-700 dark:bg-zinc-950 dark:text-zinc-100\" />\n        <input type=\"text\" inputmode=\"numeric\" pattern=\"[0-9]\" maxlength=\"1\" class=\"size-10 rounded-lg border border-zinc-300 bg-white text-center font-mono text-base font-semibold text-zinc-900 focus:border-zinc-900 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-zinc-900/10 dark:border-zinc-700 dark:bg-zinc-950 dark:text-zinc-100\" />\n        <input type=\"text\" inputmode=\"numeric\" pattern=\"[0-9]\" maxlength=\"1\" class=\"size-10 rounded-lg border border-zinc-300 bg-white text-center font-mono text-base font-semibold text-zinc-900 focus:border-zinc-900 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-zinc-900/10 dark:border-zinc-700 dark:bg-zinc-950 dark:text-zinc-100\" />\n      </div>\n      <!-- Separator -->\n      <span class=\"text-zinc-400 font-bold px-1 select-none\">—</span>\n      <!-- Group 2 -->\n      <div class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5\">\n        <input type=\"text\" inputmode=\"numeric\" pattern=\"[0-9]\" maxlength=\"1\" class=\"size-10 rounded-lg border border-zinc-300 bg-white text-center font-mono text-base font-semibold text-zinc-900 focus:border-zinc-900 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-zinc-900/10 dark:border-zinc-700 dark:bg-zinc-950 dark:text-zinc-100\" />\n        <input type=\"text\" inputmode=\"numeric\" pattern=\"[0-9]\" maxlength=\"1\" class=\"size-10 rounded-lg border border-zinc-300 bg-white text-center font-mono text-base font-semibold text-zinc-900 focus:border-zinc-900 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-zinc-900/10 dark:border-zinc-700 dark:bg-zinc-950 dark:text-zinc-100\" />\n        <input type=\"text\" inputmode=\"numeric\" pattern=\"[0-9]\" maxlength=\"1\" class=\"size-10 rounded-lg border border-zinc-300 bg-white text-center font-mono text-base font-semibold text-zinc-900 focus:border-zinc-900 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-zinc-900/10 dark:border-zinc-700 dark:bg-zinc-950 dark:text-zinc-100\" />\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- Variant 4: Underlined / Minimalist OTP Fields -->\n  <div class=\"flex flex-col gap-3\">\n    <label class=\"text-sm font-medium text-zinc-700 dark:text-zinc-300\">04. Underlined Minimalist OTP Fields</label>\n    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\">\n      <input type=\"text\" inputmode=\"numeric\" pattern=\"[0-9]\" maxlength=\"1\" class=\"h-12 w-9 border-b-2 border-zinc-300 bg-transparent text-center font-mono text-xl font-bold text-zinc-900 focus:border-zinc-900 focus:outline-none dark:border-zinc-700 dark:text-zinc-100 dark:focus:border-zinc-300\" />\n      <input type=\"text\" inputmode=\"numeric\" pattern=\"[0-9]\" maxlength=\"1\" class=\"h-12 w-9 border-b-2 border-zinc-300 bg-transparent text-center font-mono text-xl font-bold text-zinc-900 focus:border-zinc-900 focus:outline-none dark:border-zinc-700 dark:text-zinc-100 dark:focus:border-zinc-300\" />\n      <input type=\"text\" inputmode=\"numeric\" pattern=\"[0-9]\" maxlength=\"1\" class=\"h-12 w-9 border-b-2 border-zinc-300 bg-transparent text-center font-mono text-xl font-bold text-zinc-900 focus:border-zinc-900 focus:outline-none dark:border-zinc-700 dark:text-zinc-100 dark:focus:border-zinc-300\" />\n      <input type=\"text\" inputmode=\"numeric\" pattern=\"[0-9]\" maxlength=\"1\" class=\"h-12 w-9 border-b-2 border-zinc-300 bg-transparent text-center font-mono text-xl font-bold text-zinc-900 focus:border-zinc-900 focus:outline-none dark:border-zinc-700 dark:text-zinc-100 dark:focus:border-zinc-300\" />\n      <input type=\"text\" inputmode=\"numeric\" pattern=\"[0-9]\" maxlength=\"1\" class=\"h-12 w-9 border-b-2 border-zinc-300 bg-transparent text-center font-mono text-xl font-bold text-zinc-900 focus:border-zinc-900 focus:outline-none dark:border-zinc-700 dark:text-zinc-100 dark:focus:border-zinc-300\" />\n      <input type=\"text\" inputmode=\"numeric\" pattern=\"[0-9]\" maxlength=\"1\" class=\"h-12 w-9 border-b-2 border-zinc-300 bg-transparent text-center font-mono text-xl font-bold text-zinc-900 focus:border-zinc-900 focus:outline-none dark:border-zinc-700 dark:text-zinc-100 dark:focus:border-zinc-300\" />\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- Variant 5: Filled / Shaded OTP Fields -->\n  <div class=\"flex flex-col gap-3\">\n    <label class=\"text-sm font-medium text-zinc-700 dark:text-zinc-300\">05. Inset Shaded OTP Fields</label>\n    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n      <input type=\"text\" inputmode=\"numeric\" pattern=\"[0-9]\" maxlength=\"1\" class=\"size-11 rounded-lg border border-transparent bg-zinc-100 text-center font-mono text-lg font-semibold text-zinc-900 focus:border-zinc-900 focus:bg-white focus:outline-none focus:ring-1 focus:ring-zinc-900 dark:bg-zinc-900 dark:text-zinc-100 dark:focus:border-zinc-300 dark:focus:bg-zinc-950\" />\n      <input type=\"text\" inputmode=\"numeric\" pattern=\"[0-9]\" maxlength=\"1\" class=\"size-11 rounded-lg border border-transparent bg-zinc-100 text-center font-mono text-lg font-semibold text-zinc-900 focus:border-zinc-900 focus:bg-white focus:outline-none focus:ring-1 focus:ring-zinc-900 dark:bg-zinc-900 dark:text-zinc-100 dark:focus:border-zinc-300 dark:focus:bg-zinc-950\" />\n      <input type=\"text\" inputmode=\"numeric\" pattern=\"[0-9]\" maxlength=\"1\" class=\"size-11 rounded-lg border border-transparent bg-zinc-100 text-center font-mono text-lg font-semibold text-zinc-900 focus:border-zinc-900 focus:bg-white focus:outline-none focus:ring-1 focus:ring-zinc-900 dark:bg-zinc-900 dark:text-zinc-100 dark:focus:border-zinc-300 dark:focus:bg-zinc-950\" />\n      <input type=\"text\" inputmode=\"numeric\" pattern=\"[0-9]\" maxlength=\"1\" class=\"size-11 rounded-lg border border-transparent bg-zinc-100 text-center font-mono text-lg font-semibold text-zinc-900 focus:border-zinc-900 focus:bg-white focus:outline-none focus:ring-1 focus:ring-zinc-900 dark:bg-zinc-900 dark:text-zinc-100 dark:focus:border-zinc-300 dark:focus:bg-zinc-950\" />\n      <input type=\"text\" inputmode=\"numeric\" pattern=\"[0-9]\" maxlength=\"1\" class=\"size-11 rounded-lg border border-transparent bg-zinc-100 text-center font-mono text-lg font-semibold text-zinc-900 focus:border-zinc-900 focus:bg-white focus:outline-none focus:ring-1 focus:ring-zinc-900 dark:bg-zinc-900 dark:text-zinc-100 dark:focus:border-zinc-300 dark:focus:bg-zinc-950\" />\n      <input type=\"text\" inputmode=\"numeric\" pattern=\"[0-9]\" maxlength=\"1\" class=\"size-11 rounded-lg border border-transparent bg-zinc-100 text-center font-mono text-lg font-semibold text-zinc-900 focus:border-zinc-900 focus:bg-white focus:outline-none focus:ring-1 focus:ring-zinc-900 dark:bg-zinc-900 dark:text-zinc-100 dark:focus:border-zinc-300 dark:focus:bg-zinc-950\" />\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- Variant 6: OTP with Error State -->\n  <div class=\"flex flex-col gap-2\">\n    <label class=\"text-sm font-medium text-red-600 dark:text-red-400\">06. OTP Input with Error State</label>\n    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n      <input type=\"text\" value=\"8\" maxlength=\"1\" class=\"size-11 rounded-lg border-2 border-red-500 bg-white text-center font-mono text-lg font-semibold text-zinc-900 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-red-500/20 dark:bg-zinc-950 dark:text-zinc-100\" />\n      <input type=\"text\" value=\"4\" maxlength=\"1\" class=\"size-11 rounded-lg border-2 border-red-500 bg-white text-center font-mono text-lg font-semibold text-zinc-900 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-red-500/20 dark:bg-zinc-950 dark:text-zinc-100\" />\n      <input type=\"text\" value=\"2\" maxlength=\"1\" class=\"size-11 rounded-lg border-2 border-red-500 bg-white text-center font-mono text-lg font-semibold text-zinc-900 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-red-500/20 dark:bg-zinc-950 dark:text-zinc-100\" />\n      <input type=\"text\" value=\"1\" maxlength=\"1\" class=\"size-11 rounded-lg border-2 border-red-500 bg-white text-center font-mono text-lg font-semibold text-zinc-900 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-red-500/20 dark:bg-zinc-950 dark:text-zinc-100\" />\n      <input type=\"text\" value=\"9\" maxlength=\"1\" class=\"size-11 rounded-lg border-2 border-red-500 bg-white text-center font-mono text-lg font-semibold text-zinc-900 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-red-500/20 dark:bg-zinc-950 dark:text-zinc-100\" />\n      <input type=\"text\" value=\"0\" maxlength=\"1\" class=\"size-11 rounded-lg border-2 border-red-500 bg-white text-center font-mono text-lg font-semibold text-zinc-900 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-red-500/20 dark:bg-zinc-950 dark:text-zinc-100\" />\n    </div>\n    <p class=\"flex items-center gap-1 text-xs text-red-600 dark:text-red-400 mt-1\">\n      <svg class=\"size-3.5\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\">\n        <path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" d=\"M12 9v2m0 4h.01m-6.938 4h13.856c1.54 0 2.502-1.667 1.732-3L13.732 4c-.77-1.333-2.694-1.333-3.464 0L3.34 16c-.77 1.333.192 3 1.732 3z\" />\n      </svg>\n      <span>Invalid code. Check your SMS and try again.</span>\n    </p>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- Variant 7: Masked PIN OTP (Bullet Dots) -->\n  <div class=\"flex flex-col gap-3\">\n    <label class=\"text-sm font-medium text-zinc-700 dark:text-zinc-300\">07. Masked PIN (Security Bullets)</label>\n    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n      <input type=\"password\" maxlength=\"1\" value=\"1\" class=\"size-11 rounded-lg border border-zinc-300 bg-white text-center text-xl font-bold text-zinc-900 focus:border-zinc-900 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-zinc-900/10 dark:border-zinc-700 dark:bg-zinc-950 dark:text-zinc-100\" />\n      <input type=\"password\" maxlength=\"1\" value=\"2\" class=\"size-11 rounded-lg border border-zinc-300 bg-white text-center text-xl font-bold text-zinc-900 focus:border-zinc-900 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-zinc-900/10 dark:border-zinc-700 dark:bg-zinc-950 dark:text-zinc-100\" />\n      <input type=\"password\" maxlength=\"1\" value=\"3\" class=\"size-11 rounded-lg border border-zinc-300 bg-white text-center text-xl font-bold text-zinc-900 focus:border-zinc-900 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-zinc-900/10 dark:border-zinc-700 dark:bg-zinc-950 dark:text-zinc-100\" />\n      <input type=\"password\" maxlength=\"1\" class=\"size-11 rounded-lg border border-zinc-300 bg-white text-center text-xl font-bold text-zinc-900 focus:border-zinc-900 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-zinc-900/10 dark:border-zinc-700 dark:bg-zinc-950 dark:text-zinc-100\" />\n      <input type=\"password\" maxlength=\"1\" class=\"size-11 rounded-lg border border-zinc-300 bg-white text-center text-xl font-bold text-zinc-900 focus:border-zinc-900 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-zinc-900/10 dark:border-zinc-700 dark:bg-zinc-950 dark:text-zinc-100\" />\n      <input type=\"password\" maxlength=\"1\" class=\"size-11 rounded-lg border border-zinc-300 bg-white text-center text-xl font-bold text-zinc-900 focus:border-zinc-900 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-zinc-900/10 dark:border-zinc-700 dark:bg-zinc-950 dark:text-zinc-100\" />\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- Variant 8: OTP Card with Resend Timer -->\n  <div class=\"flex flex-col gap-4 max-w-sm rounded-xl border border-zinc-200 bg-white p-5 shadow-xs dark:border-zinc-800 dark:bg-zinc-900\">\n    <div class=\"space-y-1 text-center\">\n      <h3 class=\"text-base font-semibold text-zinc-900 dark:text-zinc-100\">Two-Factor Authentication</h3>\n      <p class=\"text-xs text-zinc-500 dark:text-zinc-400\">A 6-digit code was sent to ***-***-4920</p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"flex justify-center items-center gap-1.5 my-2\">\n      <input type=\"text\" inputmode=\"numeric\" maxlength=\"1\" class=\"size-10 rounded-md border border-zinc-300 bg-white text-center font-mono text-base font-semibold text-zinc-900 focus:border-zinc-900 focus:outline-none dark:border-zinc-700 dark:bg-zinc-950 dark:text-zinc-100\" />\n      <input type=\"text\" inputmode=\"numeric\" maxlength=\"1\" class=\"size-10 rounded-md border border-zinc-300 bg-white text-center font-mono text-base font-semibold text-zinc-900 focus:border-zinc-900 focus:outline-none dark:border-zinc-700 dark:bg-zinc-950 dark:text-zinc-100\" />\n      <input type=\"text\" inputmode=\"numeric\" maxlength=\"1\" class=\"size-10 rounded-md border border-zinc-300 bg-white text-center font-mono text-base font-semibold text-zinc-900 focus:border-zinc-900 focus:outline-none dark:border-zinc-700 dark:bg-zinc-950 dark:text-zinc-100\" />\n      <input type=\"text\" inputmode=\"numeric\" maxlength=\"1\" class=\"size-10 rounded-md border border-zinc-300 bg-white text-center font-mono text-base font-semibold text-zinc-900 focus:border-zinc-900 focus:outline-none dark:border-zinc-700 dark:bg-zinc-950 dark:text-zinc-100\" />\n      <input type=\"text\" inputmode=\"numeric\" maxlength=\"1\" class=\"size-10 rounded-md border border-zinc-300 bg-white text-center font-mono text-base font-semibold text-zinc-900 focus:border-zinc-900 focus:outline-none dark:border-zinc-700 dark:bg-zinc-950 dark:text-zinc-100\" />\n      <input type=\"text\" inputmode=\"numeric\" maxlength=\"1\" class=\"size-10 rounded-md border border-zinc-300 bg-white text-center font-mono text-base font-semibold text-zinc-900 focus:border-zinc-900 focus:outline-none dark:border-zinc-700 dark:bg-zinc-950 dark:text-zinc-100\" />\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between text-xs text-zinc-500 pt-2 border-t border-zinc-100 dark:border-zinc-800\">\n      <span>Didn't receive code?</span>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"font-medium text-zinc-900 dark:text-zinc-100 hover:underline\">Resend (00:45)</button>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n</div>\n",
